TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-2411.03801v2
AU  - GAROUFALIDIS, STAVROS
AU  - YOON, SEOKBEOM
TI  - 1-LOOP EQUALS TORSION FOR TWO-BRIDGE KNOTS
DA  - D:20241114
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/2411.03801
AB  - Motivated by the conjectured asymptotics of the Kashaev invariant, Dimofte and the first author introduced a power series associated to a suitable ideal triangulation of a cusped hyperbolic 3-manifold, proved that its constant (1-loop) term is a topological invariant and conjectured that it equals to the adjoint Reidemeister torsion. We prove this conjecture for hyperbolic 2-bridge knots by combining the work of Ohtsuki–Takata with an explicit computation.
ER  - 
